{"text": "Ani's teacher gives every child a small pot with a seed in it. 'Water it a little every day and put it in the sun,' she says. At home, Ani puts the pot on the kitchen window. For a week nothing happens, and Ani feels sad. Then one morning she sees a tiny green leaf! Every day the plant grows a little taller. Ani learns an important lesson: good things need time. Now she writes the plant's height in her notebook every Sunday.", "words": [[0.32, 0.66], [0.76, 1.22], [1.38, 1.62], [1.72, 1.96], [2.08, 2.5], [2.56, 2.59], [2.7, 3.0], [3.1, 3.42], [3.52, 3.66], [3.7, 3.73], [3.84, 4.1], [4.14, 4.24], [4.32, 4.48], [4.68, 6.08], [6.16, 6.26], [6.34, 6.37], [6.44, 6.78], [6.92, 7.18], [7.26, 7.56], [7.74, 7.86], [7.92, 8.1], [8.16, 8.26], [8.32, 8.4], [8.44, 8.54], [8.66, 9.36], [9.46, 9.56], [9.68, 10.06], [11.2, 11.32], [11.42, 11.78], [12.24, 12.44], [12.58, 12.82], [12.88, 12.96], [13.04, 13.34], [13.42, 13.5], [13.54, 13.62], [13.66, 14.04], [14.12, 14.54], [15.72, 15.88], [15.94, 15.97], [16.06, 16.3], [16.44, 16.76], [16.86, 17.46], [17.86, 17.98], [18.08, 18.32], [18.46, 18.8], [18.9, 19.3], [20.44, 20.6], [20.78, 20.94], [21.0, 21.4], [21.54, 21.64], [21.8, 22.12], [22.2, 22.23], [22.34, 22.72], [22.82, 23.12], [23.22, 23.54], [24.66, 24.92], [25.02, 25.26], [25.36, 25.44], [25.52, 25.92], [26.06, 26.44], [26.52, 26.55], [26.6, 26.9], [26.98, 27.42], [28.58, 28.8], [28.98, 29.38], [29.42, 29.5], [29.54, 30.18], [30.28, 30.7], [31.2, 31.38], [31.48, 31.82], [31.9, 32.1], [32.18, 32.64], [33.76, 33.96], [34.06, 34.18], [34.28, 34.62], [34.66, 34.76], [34.82, 35.22], [35.3, 35.66], [35.74, 35.82], [35.86, 35.96], [36.06, 36.6], [36.76, 36.98], [37.1, 37.733]], "tag": "en-GB-SoniaNeural", "pace": "v2-slow", "fx": "pb1", "aligned": "ctc1", "clamped": 1}